rm - remove directory entries

SYNOPSIS
    rm file ...

DESCRIPTION
    Unlink each pathname in operand order. A file survives while it has
    another hard link or an open descriptor. An empty directory can also be
    removed. Processing continues after an error.

SEE ALSO
    ln(1), rmdir(1), stat(1)
